# Rabid Bite's first target is the one that deals the damage. Bot2 destroys it in response (Get Lost on Alpine Grizzly): it is no longer
# a legal target as the spell resolves (CR 608.2b) and deals no damage, though the other target is still legal - so Bot2's Ornithopter
# (0/2: the Grizzly's 4 power would kill it) is undamaged and alive, and Rabid Bite still goes to the graveyard.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Alpine Grizzly
Rabid Bite
Island x15

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Get Lost
Ornithopter
Island x16

